00:11:00.639 --> 00:11:07.552
<v Slow>原爆が投下されたのは、朝の何時何分ですか。

00:11:08.351 --> 00:11:10.272
<v Host>Eight fifteen in the morning.

00:11:10.871 --> 00:11:20.015
<v Host>That's all for today. Eighty-one years on, Hiroshima's prayer for a world without nuclear weapons continues. See you tomorrow.

00:11:20.615 --> 00:11:23.015
